sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor RP as Responsible person
    actor EMP as Employee
    participant UI as Demo UI / API
    participant ING as ingestion.py / versioning.py
    participant TXT as Domain text processing
    participant WF as workflows.py
    participant DIFF as diff + significance domain
    participant DB as ORM / Database
    participant QWF as quiz_workflow.py
    participant ATT as quiz_attempts.py
    participant REP as result_reporting.py
    participant LLM as Optional LLM enhancer

    RP->>UI: Upload old document version
    UI->>ING: create_uploaded_document_version or create_text_document_version
    ING->>TXT: extract text from TXT/DOCX/PDF
    TXT-->>ING: extracted_text
    ING->>TXT: normalize text and build structural chunks
    TXT-->>ING: normalized_text + ChunkData
    ING->>DB: Save DocumentVersion, extracted_text, normalized_text, Chunk rows

    RP->>UI: Upload new document version
    UI->>ING: create new DocumentVersion for same Document
    ING->>TXT: extract and normalize text
    ING->>DB: Save new version and chunks

    RP->>UI: Compare selected versions
    UI->>WF: materialize_comparison(from_version, to_version)
    WF->>DIFF: build_version_diff over structural chunks
    DIFF-->>WF: diff payload with comparison metadata
    WF->>DIFF: enrich_compare_payload
    DIFF-->>WF: semantic_type, significance labels, scores, reasons
    WF->>DB: Save VersionComparison and VersionChangeItem rows
    WF->>DIFF: build_brief_summary
    DIFF-->>WF: Summary.text and highlights
    WF->>DB: Save Summary
    UI-->>RP: Show comparison and summary

    RP->>UI: Generate quiz from versions
    UI->>WF: create_quiz_from_versions
    WF->>DIFF: build_quiz_from_summary
    DIFF-->>WF: quiz payload
    WF->>DB: Save GeneratedQuiz, Question, Choice as draft
    UI-->>RP: Show draft quiz

    RP->>UI: Submit quiz for review
    UI->>QWF: submit_quiz_for_review
    QWF->>DB: status draft -> pending_review

    RP->>UI: Approve quiz
    UI->>QWF: approve_generated_quiz
    QWF->>DB: status pending_review -> approved

    EMP->>UI: Start approved quiz attempt
    UI->>ATT: start_quiz_attempt
    ATT->>QWF: ensure_quiz_attempt_allowed
    QWF-->>ATT: allowed only if approved and materialized questions exist
    ATT->>DB: Create QuizAttempt in_progress
    UI-->>EMP: Render questions

    EMP->>UI: Submit answers
    UI->>ATT: submit_started_quiz_attempt
    ATT->>DB: Read Question and Choice rows
    ATT->>ATT: evaluate_quiz_answers
    ATT->>DB: Save Answer rows and QuizAttempt score snapshot
    ATT->>REP: refresh_attempt_reporting_cache
    alt RESULT_LLM_ENABLED=True
        REP->>LLM: Generate enhanced feedback
        LLM-->>REP: Enhanced text or failure
    else RESULT_LLM_ENABLED=False
        REP->>REP: Deterministic fallback feedback
    end
    REP->>DB: Cache feedback/reporting fields

    EMP->>UI: Open result
    UI->>REP: build_attempt_result_payload
    REP->>DB: Read attempt snapshot and quiz report data
    REP-->>UI: result/reporting payload
    UI-->>EMP: Show score, feedback and report
